################################################################################
#                                                                              #
#                VERA Standard Core Simulator Input Parser                     #
#                                                                              #
################################################################################

The VERA reactor input parser react2xml.pl is installed under:

   bin/react2xml.pl

The examples are installed under:

   share/VERAIn/example/

Each of the subdirectories under the above example directory has a
run_example.sh script that will run the example, demonstrating how to run the
code.  Just open each run_example.sh script and look at what it does.

Documentation for the format of the input parser in installed under:

   share/VERAIn/doc/

More info on how to run the parser is given by:

   react2xml.pl --help

Enjoy!
